 to ten before you start talking tome.                                                    E.**etmol**To: saffrinSubj: .Cc: etmolDate: Apr 28Hmm, I reread that. Looks like I was a little upset.Just a little. Sorry for a few words, you know which ones.                                                   E.**saffrin**To: etmolSubj: simple valuesCc: saffrinDate: Apr 28It is a matter of simple values.  You accepted, by becoming a wizard, to upholdthe rules of this MUD.  It is not a matter of how we view the world.If that is the case, then I am inclined to believe that you view the worldas a place to cheat to gain what you want from life.  Maybe I am naive tobelieve that everyone will do what is right.  You once told me thatyou had both on because it was a test on the system.  The simple factris there is no excuse for not following the guidelines you agreed to.I have never misused the powers that I had when I was sheriff.  You onlyneed to ask any arch that.  To say such is a personal attack on me and my morals but then again, coming from someone who has such a blatant disregard for rules, I guess I should not be so offended.  The onlyones ever to accuse me of abusing the power were those who I caughtcheating and they could not get out of it.I follow the rules and guidelines I agreed to follow when I wizzed on here.There is no \"your own way of thinking\" when it comes to the rules thathave been laid down.S.**etmol**To: saffrinSubj: .Cc: etmolDate: Apr 28Thank for your letter, I'm glad you finally talked to me.I really am.Why don't we talk once we're both here.**etmol**To: sauronSubj: .Cc: mangla, etmolDate: Apr 29Ok, here's the story. Evil killed me way back in the church with a panther twice in a row. I told him I'd kill him for that once,and we actually had a nice conversation about the concepts of roleplaying and how this was what he has to do. I wizzed sinceand when I saw him with my player character today I rememberedand killed him. THat was probably not a good idea.. :)Anyway, he came in to my house with his wizard then and startingspitting and all that so I came in to talk to him and went netdeadwith my player. I later told him I was sorry several times buthe appeared very very very upset which is strange consideringwhat I remember from our conversation... and that he was level 6now. I told him I didn't know it meant so much to him and thatwe could group up and I'd help him regain the lost xp buthe didn't seem to want to talk or listen just told me he'd killme, and everyone from Hungary as a revenge. This lasted a longtime, me apologising, he telling me only this. Please talkto him if you can and in the meantime decide whether my kill wasjustified or not.                                           E.**volkswagen**To: etmolSubj: nem tudok bemenni a wiz. guildbe. vagy vigyel be, vagy...neDate: Apr 29de.egy magyar a 3. vilagbol**volkswagen**To: etmolSubj: vagy lehetoseg az is, hogy megyek, tenyuleg eleg sok dogom van, te meg kuldd el oket emailDate: Apr 29**schpankay**To: etmolSubj: my numberDate: Apr  201.47.07.02.74ciao dearie!Mary**etmol**To: schpankayRe:   my numberCc: etmolDate: Apr  9Mary dearest,(Un)fortunately I reached my plane just in time,it was funny, since daylight saving time startedin Europe the day I was flying, causing a littleconfusion in my tired head, anyway, I didn't havetime to call you. I'll call you the next time I'min Paris.A.**"
